&lt;p class=&quot;wnfdntt _1ibi0s3f5 _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3ea&quot;&gt;Partner with business units and engineering teams to turn requirements into reliable workflows and integrations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdntd _1ibi0s33w&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;wnfdntt _1ibi0s3f5 _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3ea&quot;&gt;Build and support ETL and ELT processes through Workato pipelines and data tools.&lt;/p&gt;
