&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Ready to do the most impactful work of your career? At&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/?utm_campaign=mt_o_m_w_m_m__coi_0_jd-onchain&amp;amp;utm_source=coinbase&quot;&gt;Coinbase&lt;/a&gt;, we are uncompromising on our mission to increase economic freedom. The bar is high, the environment is intense, and we like it that way. This isn&#39;t a place for complacency, it’s a place to be pushed past your perceived limits. If you&#39;re ready to build the future of finance alongside people who refuse to settle for &quot;good enough,&quot; you belong here. Coinbase is a remote-first, but not remote-only company. Expect to get together quarterly for intense in-person working sessions called “surges.”&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/careers&quot;&gt;learn more about working at Coinbase&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;As a Treasury &amp;amp; Banking Operations Specialist, you&#39;ll join the Treasury Operations team within Finance and help ensure Coinbase moves money safely, accurately, and on time across our global entity structure. This team owns day-to-day payment operations, liquidity management, and banking partner relationships that keep fiat rails running for millions of customers. You&#39;ll execute critical payment workflows, resolve escalated issues, and collaborate with Product and Engineering to launch new payment capabilities at the intersection of traditional finance and crypto.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own day-to-day treasury and banking operations including bank account funding, balance monitoring across all Coinbase legal entities, and liquidity forecasting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Execute daily customer payment processing across multiple fiat rails, ensuring timely and compliant settlement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Investigate and resolve escalated payment issues by conducting root-cause research and coordinating with banking partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Product and Engineering teams to test and launch new payment rail integrations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with internal compliance, legal, and finance teams to fulfill regulatory and banking requests.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a primary operations contact for banking partners, triaging issues related to fiat rail integrations and customer payments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Skills and Experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2-4 years of experience in payment operations, treasury operations, or banking with hands-on exposure to money movement across multiple payment rails.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated proficiency with ACH and multi-rail payment processing; AAP or NACHA certification strongly preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1-2 years of experience managing relationships with third-party vendors, banking institutions, or internal cross-functional partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to balance competing priorities and deliver accurate, detail-oriented work in a high-volume payment operations environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Utilizes generative AI responsibly, maintaining human oversight to deliver business-ready outputs and drive measurable improvements in workflow efficiency, cost, and quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;P77787&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
